<title>MOROCCO: Morocco confirms seeking soft wheat for October.</title>
<headline>Morocco confirms seeking soft wheat for October.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco launched on Monday a tender for the purchase of 35,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat for October arrival, an official at the state-owned Office Interprofessionnel des Cereales et Legumineuses (ONICL) said.</p>
<p>He said the quantities will be delivered between 1 and 15 October, confirming earlier trade reports.</p>
<p>The closing date for the tender is September 18 at 1530 GMT, he added, but gave no other details .</p>
<p>According the agriculture ministry, Morocco expects to import up to 1.0 million tonnes of wheat during the 1996/97 season.</p>
<p>--Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
